2026-11-07T05:17:01.2259169Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2260830Z 
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2260996Z I will:
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2261263Z 
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2261639Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2262329Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2263036Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2263680Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2264121Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2264533Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2265183Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2265801Z    /root
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2277329Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2277895Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2289637Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2290554Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2290993Z 
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2292159Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-07T05:17:01.2292668Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
